msgid "Below this rating, a text goes through. From it up to the spam threshold, it goes through but is flagged for review: a comment waits for moderation, a Gravity Forms entry gets a note, Flamingo shows it in its Antispam column. The same value as the spam threshold flags none."
msgstr ""

